{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52831","headline":"和黄三安仁山庄五首 五 · 崔颢","name":"和黄三安仁山庄五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽客岩（疑）中坐，农人野外居。\n报来禾近种，城去麦堪锄。\n夏色归舟壑，春光逐碧虚。\n君开山海记，共我摘园蔬。\n（日本藏唐抄本《新撰类林抄》卷四）（按：《国秀集》卷中、《文苑英华》卷三一八、《全唐诗》卷二五八收第二首爲蒋洌诗，《全唐诗》卷二○○又误作岑参诗，均题作《南溪别业》，文字稍异。\n今仍重收，俟考详。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}